<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 16.1.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 16.1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 580,192 shares in Polifarb Wroclaw at 16.1 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Polifarb Wroclaw was trading at 16.2 zlotys in a 15,855-share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
